OL,3,APetrol and diesel prices push inflation
OL,4,Ato highest in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigher petrol and diesel prices pushed
OL,7,Fthe UK's inflation rate up again last
OL,8,Fmonth, official figures show.
OL,10,FPrices rose 3.6% in the year to
OL,11,FOctober, up from 3.5% in September, the
OL,12,FOffice for National Statistics (ONS)
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FElevated oil prices also affected the
OL,16,Fwider economy, the ONS said, continuing
OL,17,Fto drive up the cost of raw materials
OL,18,Fand goods leaving factories.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
