OL,3,APetrol and diesel prices push inflation
OL,4,Ato highest in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation is currently at its highest
OL,7,Frate in a year and is predicted to jump
OL,8,Ffurther in the coming months. Gas and
OL,9,Felectricity bills are forecast to jump
OL,10,Fby 26% in January, according to
OL,11,Fconsultancy Cornwall Insight, adding
OL,12,F#443 to annual household energy costs
OL,13,Fwhen a new price cap comes into force.
